: [\n    \"Levamisole+cyclosporin A+Glucocorticoids\",\n    \"sirolimus\"\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"map_id\": \"pnha-alias-v2\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"PNH 首验资产身份统一映射（Reviewer-G 2026-09-11 清单 + 领域常识确定项）。别名与规范名均按小写归一匹配。不确定的对应关系不硬编码。\",\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"canonical 取 INN 为规范名；商品名/研发代号归并入 INN。\",\n    \"crovalimab=RO7112689、danicopan=ALXN2050 按公开登记常识登记；如后续来源证明不符，版本化修订本表并重跑派生。\",\n    \"v2（Reviewer-L）：ach-0144471=danicopan（NCT03053102 别名佐证）；OMS906=zaltenibart（INN）；泛称抗因子 B 单抗→SAR443809。\"\n  ],\n  \"alias_count\": 25,\n  \"matches\": {\n    \"danicopan\": \"danicopan\",\n    \"ach-0144471\": \"danicopan\",\n    \"ach0144471\": \"danicopan\",\n    \"oms906\": \"zaltenibart\"\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
