lock core research or retain credentials/Cookies/profile -> keep it nonblocking, minimally receipted, and distinguish a persisted receipt from a runnable capability. [Task 3]\n   599\t\n   600\t## Reusable knowledge\n   601\t\n   602\t- v1 framing: one public entry with testable sub-skills; existing `competitive-intelligence-workflow` skill is historical/audit input rather than current authority. The three portal positions are `全景台`, `证据室`, and `设计图谱`; the observed first-version exclusions were PDF/PPT export, spreadsheet export, radar charts, evidence-maturity views, and scheduled monitoring. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   603\t- Separate “few competitors but sufficient decision value” from an apparently under-collected landscape. For key missing data, use independent clean-context review, two recovery rounds plus final review; for competitor-universe completeness, require source convergence plus independent review. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   604\t- Publication handling allows login-dependent source access without credential collection and manual supplement files. Block when a known primary or required extension/long-term publication is unavailable; after explicit one-time confirmation, continuation can be graded rather than silently substituting evidence. Validation targets immune-mediated indications including PNH and IgAN, with large indications for collection completeness and smaller indications for detailed key-trial handling. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   605\t- Recovery must collect outputs from the current `format` node’s explicit `site_relative_path` and `manifest_relative_path`, then validate locked site/manifest plus project, contract, report identity, and snapshot chain. A legacy node lacking those bindings fails closed and preserves historical artifacts. The repaired paths passed `722` integration tests, 11 recovery tests, 42 bounded-review tests, Ruff, strict mypy, and the reported gate suites. [Task 2]\n   606\t- `SemanticGroupingProposal` and `